WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:15.400
7:40 am. Before the doors open.

2
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:27.400
Opened to standard. Signed and on record.

3
00:00:29.600 --> 00:00:37.000
Every server. Every bartender. One view.

4
00:00:39.400 --> 00:00:49.400
A new colleague. A full program on day one.

5
00:00:51.000 --> 00:01:05.000
Rung in right. Checked by the trainer.

6
00:01:06.400 --> 00:01:31.000
Graded on the floor. Signed by both.

7
00:01:33.400 --> 00:01:42.400
Trainee, trainer, manager. All on record.

8
00:01:44.600 --> 00:01:51.000
The menu changes. So does the training.

9
00:01:53.000 --> 00:02:02.400
Knowledge, checked. Not assumed.

10
00:02:04.400 --> 00:02:10.400
In their guests’ words.

11
00:02:12.600 --> 00:02:22.400
A target worth hitting.

12
00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:36.600
11:40 pm. Closed to standard.
